      "writtenOn": "2024-01-26T00:18:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I can see how it follows, but I think it\u0027s still worth being explicit that this definition implies that users who are not the current user and have an LSKF are still locked.",
      "parentUuid": "64b00dbe_f72c275f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 737,
